/apps/920320/extras/19560312802c71dd4a03675dda90d599.mp4?t=1734799264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>     <u>And most importantly: <strong>Riding Alpacas!</strong></u><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/920320/extras/92d6bb726f5c8de135edc5ab2124fc0b.poster.avif?t=1734799264\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/920320/extras/92d6bb726f5c8de135edc5ab2124fc0b.webm?t=1734799264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/920320/extras/92d6bb726f5c8de135edc5ab2124fc0b.mp4?t=1734799264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/920320/extras/188ef434bd78ce250c239b8ef7b96e68.poster.avif?t=1734799264\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/920320/extras/188ef434bd78ce250c239b8ef7b96e68.apng?t=1734799264\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
    "short_description": "Dethrone the Zodiacs, revive the Golden Age and purge the Heretics that swarm the galaxy as Virgo, the queen of Purity, in this unforgiving timed actions turn-based JRPG.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe story itself is simple, but fun! It\u2019s a great excuse to visit different locations and talk to zany characters.\u201d<br>90 \u2013 Gaming Trend<br><br>\u201c&quot;Any game where the music makes me immediately drop my controller, grab my bass guitar, and play along to learn my favorite pieces is something special.\u201d<br>88 \u2013 RPGFan<br><br>\u201cThe core gameplay is done in a fairly traditional JRPG style, with a heavy focus on timed button inputs for attacking and defending.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 gamer escape<br>",
